        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Approve Transaction",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.fordefi.com/api/v1/transactions/:id/approve",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "ID of the transaction to approve."
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Approve a transaction.\n\nA transaction awaits approval when the caller API user has been specified as a\npotential approver in the policy and the transaction\nis in the `waiting_for_approval` state."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Abort Transaction",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.fordefi.com/api/v1/transactions/:id/abort",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "ID of the transaction to abort."
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Abort a transaction.\n\nAbort is possible only for a transaction that is in one of the following states:\n   <ul>\n   <li>Waiting for approval\n   <li>Approved\n   <li>Finalized for signing\n   </ul>\n\nThe aborting user must be one of the following:\n<ul>\n<li>The user who created the transaction\n<li>An admin\n<li>A legitimate approver\n</ul>\n\nAPI users can abort only the transactions they created."
        },
        {
